{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21178","headline":"与杨十二李三早入永寿寺看牡丹 · 元稹","name":"与杨十二李三早入永寿寺看牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓入白莲宫，琉璃花界净。\n开敷多喻草，凌乱被幽径。\n压砌锦地铺，当霞日轮暎。\n蝶舞香暂飘，蠭牵蕊难正。\n笼处彩云合，露湛红珠莹。\n结叶影自交，摇风光不定。\n繁华有时节，安得保全盛。\n色见尽浮荣，希君了真性。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}